# Local development inputs — API captures, exported documentation and scratch
# notes. They are not part of the published server and may carry
# account-specific data, so they are never committed.
*-api-docs.json
*-openapi.json
*-swagger.json
*-api.csv
*-docs.txt
scratch/
notes/
